WEBVTT

01:34.729 --> 01:37.740
[Bloom Life]

01:39.000 --> 01:42.460
[1998]

01:50.240 --> 01:50.660
How is it?

01:50.660 --> 01:51.960
Just missing a little hat.

01:51.960 --> 01:52.820
My favorite when I was little

01:52.820 --> 01:54.150
was the Xinjiang dance.

01:57.300 --> 01:58.500
It looks really nice.

02:00.940 --> 02:01.360
Hello.

02:01.710 --> 02:02.360
Hello.

02:02.740 --> 02:03.510
Hello. Hello.

02:03.510 --> 02:03.910
Hello.

02:03.910 --> 02:06.990
I want to ask, is this a hotel?

02:07.010 --> 02:09.310
We want to rent long-term.

02:09.340 --> 02:10.130
Are there any available?

02:10.130 --> 02:11.140
Long-term? Sure, sure.

02:11.140 --> 02:12.370
You can rent for one or two years.

02:12.370 --> 02:12.940
Come in.

02:12.940 --> 02:13.870
Come in and take a look at the house.

02:13.870 --> 02:14.590
Take a look.

02:14.590 --> 02:15.160
Hello. Hello.

02:15.160 --> 02:15.750
Hello.

02:15.750 --> 02:17.260
Come. Take a look at both

02:17.260 --> 02:17.920
upstairs and downstairs.

02:17.920 --> 02:18.750
A pony!

02:18.750 --> 02:20.210
You even have a horse here.

02:21.250 --> 02:22.200
Well, my horse

02:22.230 --> 02:23.090
eats grass.

02:23.110 --> 02:24.640
Your iron donkey

02:24.670 --> 02:25.730
doesn't eat grass?

02:27.940 --> 02:28.210
Come.

02:28.210 --> 02:29.470
Go inside and take a look.

02:29.470 --> 02:31.000
Your house is so beautiful.

02:32.190 --> 02:33.250
It's so beautiful.

02:36.340 --> 02:38.150
Are you pregnant?

02:42.420 --> 02:43.190
I just ate.

02:43.190 --> 02:43.870
Thank you, auntie.

02:43.870 --> 02:44.540
I'm not hungry.

02:44.540 --> 02:45.140
Thank you. Thank you.

02:45.140 --> 02:46.100
Let me see.

02:48.100 --> 02:49.040
Is it this one?

02:49.250 --> 02:49.880
No.

02:50.860 --> 02:52.490
-No. Don’t move. Don't move.
-Let me.

02:52.490 --> 02:52.890
Right.

02:52.970 --> 02:53.480
This one?

02:53.480 --> 02:53.920
Yes.

02:58.010 --> 02:58.810
Thank you.

03:00.180 --> 03:00.950
Wait, why...

03:00.980 --> 03:03.160
are you suddenly so polite?

03:03.420 --> 03:04.480
Really, I think

03:05.570 --> 03:07.470
coming here to establish a TCM department

03:07.470 --> 03:09.200
has given me a stage to perform.

03:09.710 --> 03:11.540
But you were already doing so well

03:11.540 --> 03:13.830
in the surgery department at our hospital.

03:13.830 --> 03:15.960
It's really unfair to you to come here.

03:22.760 --> 03:24.130
The land here is so vast.

03:28.010 --> 03:28.810
How

03:29.460 --> 03:31.010
can love become narrow?

03:35.290 --> 03:37.690
You are truly the best
husband in the world.

03:37.880 --> 03:39.040
Of course.

03:49.290 --> 03:50.420
My name is Xia Zi.

03:50.690 --> 03:53.130
When my parents chose to aid Xinjiang,

03:53.710 --> 03:55.930
the Camel Bell Inn became my home.

03:57.290 --> 03:58.660
Grandma Ayihan

03:58.660 --> 04:00.510
gave me a beautiful name,

04:00.880 --> 04:02.090
Arzugul.

04:02.940 --> 04:03.510
Uncle

04:03.910 --> 04:04.510
and aunt

04:05.190 --> 04:07.250
treat me like their own daughter.

04:08.250 --> 04:10.320
The innkeeper's daughter, Minawar, and

04:10.320 --> 04:12.470
Laili from the earthenware shop next door

04:12.470 --> 04:13.870
became my best friends.

04:15.350 --> 04:16.880
We went to school together,

04:17.089 --> 04:18.089
played together,

04:18.540 --> 04:19.740
and grew up together.

04:20.519 --> 04:22.250
We could fly freely and happily

04:22.520 --> 04:25.250
like little doves.

04:26.170 --> 04:27.300
The sun in Kashgar

04:27.820 --> 04:29.130
seems to never set.

04:29.130 --> 04:31.670
Dad, can you chill
a couple of watermelon slices for me?

04:31.670 --> 04:32.510
Uncle Xia.

04:32.880 --> 04:33.880
Thank you.

04:42.480 --> 04:46.390
[Episode 1 A Farewell That Came Too Late]

04:48.060 --> 04:57.300
[Shanghai, 2024]

04:55.320 --> 04:55.820
Hello.

04:56.320 --> 04:56.960
Ms. Liu,

04:57.340 --> 04:59.380
have you thought about the house

04:59.690 --> 05:01.550
I introduced to you the other day?

05:02.190 --> 05:02.760
Do you need me to go to your company

05:02.760 --> 05:04.730
and introduce it to you again?

05:06.640 --> 05:07.170
Hello?

05:08.570 --> 05:09.440
Excuse me, coming through.

05:09.440 --> 05:09.870
Thank you.

05:09.870 --> 05:11.840
The train is arriving at
Zhongshan Park Station.

05:11.840 --> 05:14.730
Please exit through the left-side doors.

05:15.060 --> 05:18.710
The train is arriving at
Zhongshan Park Station.

05:18.840 --> 05:19.700
Please exit...

05:22.060 --> 05:23.890
Clock-in failed.

05:23.910 --> 05:25.410
Out of clock-in range.

05:25.440 --> 05:26.400
Clock-in failed.

05:26.400 --> 05:27.840
Out of clock-in range.

05:32.810 --> 05:34.130
Out of clock-in range.

05:34.380 --> 05:35.970
Out of clock-in range.

05:38.159 --> 05:39.420
Clock-in successful.

05:47.550 --> 05:48.750
Listen up, everyone.

05:49.510 --> 05:51.170
Today is the last day.

05:52.110 --> 05:54.750
Submit all the reports before leaving.

05:55.500 --> 05:56.800
Xia Zi, come here for a moment.

05:56.800 --> 05:57.409
Okay.

06:00.580 --> 06:01.430
What's wrong

06:01.430 --> 06:02.460
with your team?

06:03.900 --> 06:04.940
The region's performance

06:04.940 --> 06:06.870
has been dragged down by you Team 2.

06:07.010 --> 06:08.740
Look at the neighboring Team 1.

06:08.880 --> 06:11.210
They consistently exceed their targets.

06:11.740 --> 06:13.340
You really need to reflect on

06:14.310 --> 06:16.170
how you're leading the team.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.110
Yes.

06:18.640 --> 06:19.820
Don't worry, Mr. Li.

06:20.130 --> 06:21.640
We will work harder today

06:21.720 --> 06:23.380
and strive to meet the target.

06:27.930 --> 06:29.900
Ms. Xia, we still need over 5 million
to hit the target.

06:29.900 --> 06:30.520
What should we do?

06:30.520 --> 06:31.630
If it weren't for Mr. Li giving all his

06:31.630 --> 06:33.440
high-net-worth clients to his own people,

06:33.440 --> 06:35.260
we wouldn't be behind by so much.

06:49.170 --> 06:51.460
We're celebrating Minawar's birthday
in the banquet hall tonight.

06:51.460 --> 06:53.060
I'll sent you pictures then.

06:53.200 --> 06:54.080
Ms. Xia,

06:54.230 --> 06:56.159
remember to check your phone then.

06:59.890 --> 07:02.390
[Kashgar]

07:21.380 --> 07:23.930
Laili.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.130
Laili.

07:28.250 --> 07:29.510
The delivery is here.

07:35.940 --> 07:39.320
Laili.

07:41.990 --> 07:43.560
Laili, you're here so early today.

07:43.560 --> 07:45.490
I can work a bit more if I come early.

07:46.330 --> 07:47.890
What a hardworking girl.

07:47.540 --> 07:53.980
[Nangbao Delivery Station]

08:03.090 --> 08:04.560
♪Don't treat strangers as lovers♪

08:04.590 --> 08:06.390
♪Don't treat outsiders as lovers♪

08:06.410 --> 08:11.860
♪Beautiful lover♪

08:12.010 --> 08:13.840
♪Willow branches grow upon the tree♪

08:13.860 --> 08:16.110
♪But their tips drift far apart♪

08:16.130 --> 08:18.370
♪I've already lived within your heart♪

08:18.390 --> 08:20.930
♪But our homes lie far away♪

08:20.950 --> 08:23.170
♪I've already lived within your heart♪

08:23.190 --> 08:25.750
♪But our homes lie far away♪

08:25.780 --> 08:27.500
♪Distance between homes is nothing♪

08:27.520 --> 08:30.530
♪So long as hearts don't drift apart♪

08:30.550 --> 08:32.240
♪Distance between homes is nothing♪

08:32.260 --> 08:35.140
♪So long as hearts don't drift apart♪

08:35.169 --> 08:37.000
♪Distance between homes is nothing♪

08:37.030 --> 08:39.900
♪So long as hearts don't drift apart♪

08:39.970 --> 08:45.900
♪The promise between us must never change♪

08:57.830 --> 08:58.830
Home? Whose home?

08:58.830 --> 09:00.350
The home bought for this mistress?

09:00.350 --> 09:01.900
When you signed the contract, did you

09:01.900 --> 09:03.180
even ask him how many wives he has?

09:03.180 --> 09:04.350
This woman is a mistress.

09:04.350 --> 09:06.410
All her savings come from my husband.

09:06.880 --> 09:08.900
How do you feel about the unit

09:09.050 --> 09:09.780
I recommended last time?

09:09.780 --> 09:10.870
Refund this house to me.

09:10.870 --> 09:11.730
This contract cannot be signed.

09:11.730 --> 09:12.510
I'm telling you.

09:12.510 --> 09:14.320
Ma'am, this money can't be refunded.

09:14.320 --> 09:15.660
The person involved hasn't said a word.

09:15.660 --> 09:17.350
Did I ask you?

09:21.790 --> 09:22.910
Stop arguing first.

09:22.910 --> 09:23.710
Stop arguing.

09:24.160 --> 09:25.040
What's wrong?

09:25.220 --> 09:26.800
Hello, I'm the sales manager here.

09:26.800 --> 09:28.060
It's useless no matter who you call.

09:28.060 --> 09:29.600
You real estate agents

09:30.160 --> 09:31.570
care only about your commission.

09:31.570 --> 09:33.010
If you don't cancel this sale today,

09:33.010 --> 09:33.730
I will sue you.

09:33.730 --> 09:34.210
Go ahead.

09:34.210 --> 09:35.270
Go ahead and sue us.

09:35.580 --> 09:36.420
I'm telling you,

09:36.420 --> 09:38.350
I'm definitely buying this house.

09:38.780 --> 09:41.400
Ma'am.

09:46.730 --> 09:47.560
Mrs. Su,

09:48.010 --> 09:48.850
this

09:48.850 --> 09:51.280
is mint tea from my hometown, Kashgar.

09:51.580 --> 09:53.460
Have some tea and calm down.

09:57.430 --> 09:58.400
Mrs. Su,

10:00.180 --> 10:01.850
let me say a few more words.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.300
Even though this house

10:04.630 --> 10:05.130
was paid for

10:05.130 --> 10:07.230
using Ms. Zhang's account,

10:08.230 --> 10:09.420
the financial transactions

10:09.420 --> 10:11.060
between her and your husband

10:11.060 --> 10:12.290
are all traceable.

10:13.060 --> 10:14.300
This can serve as evidence to protect

10:14.300 --> 10:16.100
your legal rights in the future.

10:20.670 --> 10:23.550
Xia Zi, times have changed.

10:23.710 --> 10:25.880
You know how hard it is to close a deal.

10:25.910 --> 10:27.260
You know that, right?

10:27.300 --> 10:28.640
You sympathize with her,

10:28.640 --> 10:30.300
but who sympathizes with you?

10:31.020 --> 10:33.150
The company only looks at numbers now.

10:33.420 --> 10:34.820
Fail to hit your targets,

10:34.890 --> 10:36.770
you'll be fired sooner or later.

10:44.880 --> 10:47.480
You didn't pick up my calls
even on my birthday.

11:06.190 --> 11:07.550
I brought your dad back.

11:08.310 --> 11:09.340
Hurry up and book a ticket

11:09.340 --> 11:10.270
back to Kashgar.

11:28.350 --> 11:29.650
Passengers,

11:29.680 --> 11:31.750
the train has arrived at Kashgar Station.

11:31.750 --> 11:33.730
Passengers getting off at Kashgar Station,

11:33.730 --> 11:35.650
please have your luggage ready.

11:35.670 --> 11:36.350
Bro,

11:36.370 --> 11:37.540
with our relationship,

11:37.540 --> 11:39.140
talking about money is tacky.

11:39.140 --> 11:39.950
Other platforms

11:39.950 --> 11:41.550
are giving me free exposure.

11:42.380 --> 11:44.180
With your resources and skills,

11:44.220 --> 11:46.480
we could definitely make a regional hit.

11:48.260 --> 11:49.260
Don't worry.

11:49.820 --> 11:50.460
I...

11:52.970 --> 11:53.680
Excuse me.

11:55.340 --> 11:56.720
I-It's fine.

13:01.230 --> 13:01.750
Sir.

13:03.160 --> 13:05.300
Do you know this place?

13:05.300 --> 13:07.160
I know it, child. I know it.

13:07.160 --> 13:08.420
Then how do I get there?

13:11.940 --> 13:13.250
It's over there.

13:14.800 --> 13:15.470
Over there.

13:15.500 --> 13:17.100
No, no, no. Sir, are you sure?

13:17.520 --> 13:19.450
I just asked another man earlier,

13:19.470 --> 13:21.120
and he said the exact same thing as you.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.150
Just go from here.

13:22.170 --> 13:23.390
It's over there.

13:23.420 --> 13:23.880
Then I'll arrive.

13:23.880 --> 13:24.830
But... but it's not there.

13:24.830 --> 13:25.780
If it's not there...

13:25.780 --> 13:26.970
No, no.

13:27.000 --> 13:28.160
It is over there.

13:28.280 --> 13:29.410
It's not over there.

13:29.810 --> 13:31.380
It's over there.

13:56.810 --> 13:59.830
Aletong, you both came to help.

13:59.850 --> 14:01.660
What about the restaurant's business?

14:01.660 --> 14:04.140
It's fine, we're taking a day off.

14:04.160 --> 14:05.490
Exactly.

14:06.460 --> 14:06.900
Running a shop

14:06.900 --> 14:08.630
isn't as important as Meshrep.

14:10.730 --> 14:11.250
Nur,

14:11.250 --> 14:12.750
this isn't like you.

14:12.850 --> 14:15.210
You've already spent a coin.

14:15.590 --> 14:17.850
Flipping it won't let you spend it twice.

14:18.250 --> 14:20.580
Are you really okay with not making money?

14:21.200 --> 14:24.320
Xia Hui is also a dear friend to me.

14:24.320 --> 14:26.180
When that couple of great doctors

14:26.370 --> 14:28.680
came to Xinjiang for aid work

14:28.680 --> 14:30.410
and rented a room in your house,

14:30.630 --> 14:33.280
we all became like family.

14:37.710 --> 14:38.590
Uncle.

14:39.180 --> 14:40.250
I want two skewers.

14:42.580 --> 14:43.470
Be more gentle.

14:43.940 --> 14:44.610
You're a girl.

14:44.610 --> 14:46.040
Don't act like you've been starved.

14:46.040 --> 14:48.130
When I don't have to work 3 jobs a day,

14:48.130 --> 14:49.680
I'll learn to be gentle from you.

14:49.680 --> 14:50.350
Okay.

14:54.560 --> 14:56.300
She just got off the bus.

14:56.300 --> 14:57.830
We just talked on the phone.

14:57.900 --> 14:58.680
Let me tell you,

14:58.680 --> 15:00.180
you need to be as gentle as a lamb today.

15:00.180 --> 15:01.350
Be good, okay?

15:01.350 --> 15:02.920
On such a special day today,

15:02.920 --> 15:04.680
don't you two start fighting again.

15:04.680 --> 15:06.010
Okay, I know.

15:06.010 --> 15:08.240
The little girl is even
giving her big sister a lecture now.

15:08.240 --> 15:10.510
Anyway, don't argue about anything today.

15:10.510 --> 15:12.590
If she says the snowmelt
from the Tianshan Mountains is sweet,

15:12.590 --> 15:13.050
you say,

15:13.630 --> 15:14.920
'It's even sweeter than melons.'

15:14.920 --> 15:15.870
If she says

15:15.940 --> 15:17.130
corals can grow in the desert,

15:17.130 --> 15:17.640
you say,

15:17.660 --> 15:18.920
'Let's go dig them up tomorrow.'

15:18.920 --> 15:19.970
Okay, I know.

15:19.970 --> 15:21.400
I'm not a 3-year-old.

15:22.350 --> 15:23.320
Look at them.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.180
Minawar's fiance is here
to pick her up again.

15:24.180 --> 15:25.540
So beautiful.

15:25.920 --> 15:27.810
Today, they're even treating us
to a whole roasted lamb.

15:27.810 --> 15:29.120
You're so pretty.

15:37.850 --> 15:39.090
I want to go take a picture with her.

15:39.090 --> 15:40.440
You go. I'm an introvert.

15:40.440 --> 15:41.680
Come, come, come.

15:41.680 --> 15:42.200
Go.

15:42.200 --> 15:43.060
Thank you, Grandma.

15:43.060 --> 15:44.280
Wait a moment.

15:45.900 --> 15:48.360
I told you
she doesn't want to take a picture.

15:53.470 --> 15:55.160
Thank you, Grandma.

15:55.560 --> 15:56.200
Let's go.

16:14.840 --> 16:18.450
My little pigeon has flown back.

16:19.040 --> 16:20.210
Grandma.

16:24.660 --> 16:26.250
I'm back.

16:33.590 --> 16:34.900
Will it survive?

16:35.200 --> 16:36.010
It will.

16:36.680 --> 16:38.090
There should still be a chance.

16:38.090 --> 16:39.350
I think it'll survive.

16:40.090 --> 16:42.440
A fig can grow in a palace's flowerpot,

16:42.440 --> 16:44.490
but it can also grow
in the farmer's field.

16:44.490 --> 16:46.350
Arzugul, soak it in water.

16:44.810 --> 16:46.440
[Arzugul, Arzugul’s nickname]

16:46.380 --> 16:47.780
I'll go home and get a pot.

16:47.870 --> 16:48.400
Go ahead.

17:02.700 --> 17:03.370
Um,

17:04.089 --> 17:05.180
excuse me,

17:05.180 --> 17:07.050
is this the Camel Bell Inn?

17:07.180 --> 17:08.420
Yes, this is my home.

17:10.200 --> 17:11.510
Dad, we have a guest.

17:20.640 --> 17:21.470
Hello, I...

17:21.470 --> 17:22.290
Young man,

17:23.270 --> 17:24.740
what are you

17:24.849 --> 17:26.200
looking around for?

17:26.859 --> 17:29.140
Are you here to stay at our inn?

17:29.370 --> 17:31.980
Yes, sir. Your place is so hard to find.

17:32.200 --> 17:34.210
Several people said that way,

17:34.210 --> 17:35.290
but they all said differently.

17:35.290 --> 17:36.890
If we Kashgar people tell you

17:37.510 --> 17:38.440
it's over there,

17:38.620 --> 17:40.620
you'll have to walk for ten minutes.

17:40.790 --> 17:42.010
If they say

17:42.010 --> 17:43.530
it's over there,

17:43.530 --> 17:45.730
you'll have to walk for thirty minutes.

17:45.790 --> 17:48.160
That's Kashgar's sense of humor.

17:49.140 --> 17:51.550
According to the internet, your guesthouse

17:51.550 --> 17:52.810
is the oldest in all of Kashgar, right?

17:52.810 --> 17:55.340
I wouldn't call it the oldest.

17:55.990 --> 17:56.660
But

17:57.100 --> 17:58.710
the deed for our house

17:59.010 --> 18:00.380
is written on sheepskin.

18:00.380 --> 18:01.160
See this?

18:01.160 --> 18:02.900
This pillar in our house

18:03.400 --> 18:04.530
is over a hundred years old

18:04.530 --> 18:05.900
and still in great shape.

18:05.900 --> 18:06.440
This pillar

18:06.440 --> 18:08.470
was specially made from apricot wood.

18:08.470 --> 18:09.640
A hundred years from now,

18:09.640 --> 18:11.750
it'll still be like this, perfectly fine.

18:11.750 --> 18:13.010
This is pretty good.

18:13.010 --> 18:14.750
The location of your inn

18:14.750 --> 18:16.010
is really hard to find.

18:16.640 --> 18:17.920
Even in peak season, no need to book.

18:17.920 --> 18:19.180
There are still rooms.

18:19.790 --> 18:21.450
It seems Kashgar doesn't have

18:21.620 --> 18:22.730
that many tourists.

18:22.730 --> 18:23.770
Young man.

18:23.770 --> 18:25.900
They are the only ones with rooms left.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.960
The rest

18:26.960 --> 18:27.860
are all full.

18:27.860 --> 18:29.180
Go, go, go.

18:31.620 --> 18:32.290
Young man.

18:33.290 --> 18:36.290
Sorry, we're not open today.

18:36.290 --> 18:38.490
We're not taking any new guests.

18:38.820 --> 18:40.620
Hey, isn't that girl a guest?

18:41.210 --> 18:42.620
Why can she stay here?

18:43.380 --> 18:44.770
She's our child.

18:44.770 --> 18:47.310
She's my best friend Xia Hui's daughter.

18:58.550 --> 18:59.470
Friend,

18:59.470 --> 19:01.640
if you insist on staying at our inn today,

19:01.640 --> 19:03.040
there's nothing I can do.

19:03.270 --> 19:03.860
But we're having

19:03.860 --> 19:05.770
a Meshrep tonight.

19:05.770 --> 19:07.420
I'm afraid of disturbing you,

19:07.420 --> 19:08.200
you know?

19:08.790 --> 19:09.440
Sir,

19:10.160 --> 19:12.470
what's a Meshrep?

19:13.100 --> 19:14.140
You don't even know

19:14.140 --> 19:15.140
what a Meshrep is?

19:15.550 --> 19:16.360
A Meshrep

19:16.360 --> 19:17.290
is just about all of us

19:17.290 --> 19:18.810
getting together,

19:18.810 --> 19:20.270
eating,

19:20.520 --> 19:21.500
drinking tea,

19:21.620 --> 19:23.440
and having a good time.

19:26.210 --> 19:27.120
But today,

19:27.120 --> 19:28.310
this Meshrep

19:29.700 --> 19:30.750
is a bit special.

19:30.970 --> 19:31.970
Especially good?

19:33.620 --> 19:34.380
Friend.

19:37.490 --> 19:38.440
Our neighbor,

19:38.440 --> 19:39.960
this meatbun, loves here.

19:39.960 --> 19:40.700
Look! Ha!

19:40.880 --> 19:42.560
Get some good rest, young man.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.520
Come down later.

19:50.140 --> 19:50.900
Laili,

19:51.070 --> 19:52.680
call my daughter

19:52.680 --> 19:53.810
and see where she is.

19:59.990 --> 20:00.550
Hurry.

20:01.510 --> 20:02.440
Come here.

20:02.920 --> 20:03.650
I'm leaving.

20:04.600 --> 20:05.070
Okay.

20:07.460 --> 20:08.770
I'll pick you up tomorrow.

20:08.770 --> 20:09.840
Hurry. Hurry. Hurry.

20:09.840 --> 20:11.100
Your dad is angry.

20:11.640 --> 20:13.000
Dad, I'm back.

20:13.140 --> 20:14.030
You're back.

20:14.030 --> 20:14.810
I'm back.

20:18.000 --> 20:18.700
Arzugul.

20:20.380 --> 20:21.110
You're back.

20:22.620 --> 20:23.470
-Alimu.
-Dad.

20:23.470 --> 20:24.200
Uncle.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.750
Alimu is here.

20:26.030 --> 20:26.790
Laili.

20:29.290 --> 20:29.960
Is this

20:30.380 --> 20:31.270
Arzugul?

20:31.550 --> 20:32.950
How did you get so pretty?

20:33.860 --> 20:35.190
Was I not pretty before?

20:35.700 --> 20:36.700
No, no, no.

20:37.010 --> 20:38.790
You are just pretty.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.420
But some people

20:40.420 --> 20:41.990
are not only pretty,

20:41.990 --> 20:43.180
but also know how to manipulate others.

20:43.180 --> 20:44.180
How have I manipulated others?

20:44.180 --> 20:45.080
Don't you know?

20:45.180 --> 20:46.550
Thank you, Alimu.

20:46.550 --> 20:48.550
Didn't your brother say
he'd be back these days?

20:48.550 --> 20:49.810
Why haven't I seen him?

20:50.160 --> 20:51.710
You're still thinking about my brother?

20:51.710 --> 20:53.530
He works hard enough driving out there.

20:53.530 --> 20:56.030
He even went out of his way
to buy you handmade chocolates.

20:56.030 --> 20:58.760
Minawar,
if you're not interested in my brother,

20:58.890 --> 21:00.640
then don't let him run errands for you,

21:00.640 --> 21:01.140
okay?

21:02.160 --> 21:03.310
You haven't changed a bit.

21:03.310 --> 21:04.490
Still so sharp-tongued, huh?

21:04.490 --> 21:05.340
Go.

21:08.290 --> 21:09.200
Arzugul.

21:10.790 --> 21:11.600
I want to eat too.

21:11.600 --> 21:12.100
You eat.

21:12.440 --> 21:13.180
Minawar.

21:13.810 --> 21:15.990
Laili said you went out to the countryside
to perform.

21:15.990 --> 21:16.790
Are you tired?

21:17.250 --> 21:18.660
How could I be tired?

21:18.660 --> 21:20.470
My boyfriend bought a new car.

21:20.470 --> 21:21.730
He drives me every day.

21:21.880 --> 21:22.750
However, some people

21:22.750 --> 21:24.440
didn't even come out to meet us.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.900
Arzugul went off to do her thing.

21:25.900 --> 21:26.840
Is it confirmed?

21:27.070 --> 21:28.440
If you are sure he's the one,

21:28.440 --> 21:29.530
it's not too late to meet.

21:29.530 --> 21:30.790
They're getting engaged.

21:30.790 --> 21:33.070
People coming back from Shanghai
are indeed different.

21:33.070 --> 21:34.380
You've gotten so full of yourself.

21:34.380 --> 21:36.730
You didn't even bother
to call me on my birthday.

21:36.730 --> 21:37.350
Laili,

21:37.920 --> 21:38.520
come here.

21:39.010 --> 21:39.670
Let's chat.

21:43.710 --> 21:44.840
Come, sit closer.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.770
I came all the way back from Shanghai,

21:47.770 --> 21:48.660
you didn't even come to pick me up.

21:48.660 --> 21:49.730
But you expected me to go and meet you?

21:49.730 --> 21:52.010
There was a situation.

21:52.010 --> 21:52.970
A situation?

21:52.970 --> 21:55.430
A boyfriend matters more
than a best friend.

21:59.730 --> 22:01.560
Arzugul, eat more.

22:01.580 --> 22:02.550
Okay.

22:03.360 --> 22:04.490
Thank you, Grandma.

22:07.430 --> 22:09.530
Arzugul, since you came back this time,

22:09.530 --> 22:11.050
can you stay for a few more days?

22:11.050 --> 22:12.070
I'm not sure yet.

22:12.070 --> 22:12.990
I don't have much time off,

22:12.990 --> 22:14.420
so I might go back after I'm done.

22:14.420 --> 22:15.050
That fast?

22:15.550 --> 22:16.990
You haven't changed much.

22:16.990 --> 22:17.840
Dad.

22:17.840 --> 22:19.190
It's been less than a year

22:19.190 --> 22:20.120
since Arzugul last came back.

22:20.120 --> 22:21.380
What could have changed?

22:21.380 --> 22:22.620
Arzugul is now a manager

22:22.620 --> 22:25.250
at a big company in Shanghai.

22:26.340 --> 22:27.120
What manager?

22:27.120 --> 22:27.880
I am just working

22:27.880 --> 22:29.380
for someone else.

22:29.380 --> 22:31.400
Not all jobs are the same.

22:31.400 --> 22:32.660
Xia Zi

22:32.660 --> 22:34.770
is a director

22:34.770 --> 22:36.250
at a real estate company in Shanghai.

22:36.250 --> 22:38.660
Turns out my granddaughter is amazing.

22:38.800 --> 22:40.720
My daughter, Laili, told me that

22:40.880 --> 22:43.200
Arzugul even bought a house in Shanghai.

22:43.490 --> 22:45.820
It's not a big house.

22:46.680 --> 22:47.990
Back in the day,

22:47.990 --> 22:49.730
Arzugul's parents

22:49.730 --> 22:50.730
were very busy.

22:50.730 --> 22:52.460
I raised her single-handedly.

22:52.970 --> 22:53.640
As you know,

22:53.640 --> 22:54.900
I used to build houses.

22:55.290 --> 22:56.660
This guest room on the second floor,

22:56.660 --> 22:57.770
I built it myself.

22:57.770 --> 22:58.960
When I was building this house,

22:58.960 --> 23:00.230
I was mixing cement over there,

23:00.230 --> 23:02.010
and Arzugul was sitting beside me,

23:02.010 --> 23:04.290
playing with mud.

23:04.970 --> 23:06.730
The little camel knows the way

23:07.050 --> 23:09.880
only because the old camel led it well.

23:10.140 --> 23:12.050
Camels are camels, alpacas are alpacas.

23:12.050 --> 23:13.420
They just look alike.

23:13.420 --> 23:16.460
Arzugul is an architectural designer.

23:16.460 --> 23:18.160
You are just a construction worker.
It's different.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.470
How can it be the same?

23:20.770 --> 23:23.030
Later, when Arzugul takes you to Shanghai

23:23.030 --> 23:25.420
to see the skyscrapers she built,

23:25.420 --> 23:26.550
you will know.

23:28.900 --> 23:29.920
That's true.

23:30.470 --> 23:31.400
Arzugul has been

23:31.730 --> 23:34.120
top of her class since she was young.

23:34.120 --> 23:36.380
She is very smart and always comes first.

25:11.770 --> 25:14.290
Too bad the moon is hiding tonight.

25:21.120 --> 25:21.920
They are here.

25:22.600 --> 25:23.400
Here.

26:38.090 --> 26:39.610
I brought your dad back.

26:40.450 --> 26:41.400
Don't be too sad.

26:42.230 --> 26:43.960
Your dad would be heartbroken.

26:59.440 --> 27:00.120
Go inside.

27:01.940 --> 27:02.680
Come in.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.710
We are gathered here today

27:11.990 --> 27:13.640
to say goodbye to our

27:14.100 --> 27:15.010
good brother

27:15.840 --> 27:16.770
and good friend,

27:17.030 --> 27:17.900
Xia Hui.

27:18.530 --> 27:20.600
He was serving as a foreign aid doctor

27:20.600 --> 27:22.550
when he encountered local conflict

27:22.550 --> 27:24.010
and was tragically killed

27:24.010 --> 27:25.140
in an explosion.

27:25.850 --> 27:26.920
It has been over half a year

27:26.920 --> 27:28.270
since he passed away.

27:29.210 --> 27:30.340
Our sister-in-law,

27:30.640 --> 27:31.370
Chang Yue,

27:31.900 --> 27:33.420
brought him back home.

27:36.750 --> 27:37.680
Let's talk about

27:37.960 --> 27:40.730
the beautiful memories

27:41.180 --> 27:42.640
Xia Hui left for each of us.

27:47.570 --> 27:48.640
The last time Hui

27:50.120 --> 27:52.270
called me,

27:52.600 --> 27:55.390
he said he would be back in half a year.

27:55.410 --> 27:58.430
He told me to take care of my health

27:58.460 --> 28:00.900
and take my medicine on time every day.

28:01.270 --> 28:04.070
He also specifically asked Yue

28:04.570 --> 28:06.470
to give me this watch.

28:06.940 --> 28:09.010
Whenever I think of Hui,

28:09.080 --> 28:11.040
I feel very sad.

28:12.020 --> 28:14.380
The last time Uncle Xia contacted me

28:14.940 --> 28:16.620
was about a year ago.

28:17.530 --> 28:19.790
He suddenly called me and

28:20.270 --> 28:22.250
praised my performance.

28:22.900 --> 28:25.960
Then he bought twenty tickets

28:25.960 --> 28:27.560
and gave them to his friends.

28:28.460 --> 28:30.390
I used to chat with Uncle Xia often.

28:31.290 --> 28:32.290
He asked me

28:32.510 --> 28:34.440
how to add effects to short videos.

28:35.130 --> 28:37.790
He even said
he wanted to create his own account.

28:44.250 --> 28:45.070
Xia.

28:45.640 --> 28:47.880
The last thing he said to me

28:47.880 --> 28:49.970
were in a comment on my social media.

28:51.600 --> 28:53.660
He posted, "These flowers finally bloomed,

28:53.660 --> 28:54.900
congratulations!

28:55.360 --> 28:57.420
It's almost as beautiful as my wife."

29:01.660 --> 29:04.510
The last time Xia Hui called me,

29:05.600 --> 29:06.340
he said,

29:06.550 --> 29:07.200
"Brother,

29:07.200 --> 29:09.180
I eat bread every day here.

29:10.270 --> 29:13.010
I really miss our thin-skinned buns.”

29:14.900 --> 29:17.010
When Xia Hui called me,

29:17.010 --> 29:18.050
he said,

29:18.400 --> 29:18.990
"Nur,

29:19.420 --> 29:21.400
don't forget you have high blood pressure.

29:21.400 --> 29:24.900
You must take care of your health.

29:24.920 --> 29:26.250
Eat less greasy food,

29:26.250 --> 29:28.250
and don't overexert yourself."

29:28.250 --> 29:29.990
That's what he told me.

29:33.320 --> 29:36.240
♪My longed-for lover♪

29:36.280 --> 29:47.500
♪May you live a thousand years♪

29:49.370 --> 29:57.840
♪Lift your veil and let me see♪

29:54.850 --> 29:56.420
Everyone, stop crying.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.370
Don't cry.

29:57.840 --> 29:58.510
We

29:58.180 --> 30:05.640
♪Your flower-like smile♪

29:58.510 --> 30:00.160
can't let Xia laugh at us.

30:01.360 --> 30:02.360
Let's sing.

30:02.640 --> 30:03.360
Sing.

30:03.360 --> 30:05.570
Xia would want us to live happily.

30:10.000 --> 30:13.500
♪Since the moment I saw you, my love♪

30:13.530 --> 30:21.210
♪I've fallen into the pit of worries♪

30:21.350 --> 30:25.180
♪Oh dear love♪

30:25.200 --> 30:29.320
♪Where could there be a flower like you?♪

30:29.350 --> 30:36.680
♪A lover with eyes that burn like fire♪

30:36.750 --> 30:48.060
♪Oh, my love♪

30:48.350 --> 30:51.780
♪A lover with eyes that burn like fire♪

30:55.440 --> 30:56.210
Wang,

30:56.460 --> 30:58.230
hurry up and show me your guesthouse.

30:58.230 --> 30:58.620
Anyway,

30:58.620 --> 31:01.020
we've already signed the contract, right?

31:01.180 --> 31:03.290
Your taste is absolutely fine.

31:03.290 --> 31:05.180
I trust you 100%.

31:07.810 --> 31:08.600
Hello.

31:09.840 --> 31:10.380
Ms. Xia.

31:10.420 --> 31:10.920
Did you get

31:10.920 --> 31:12.120
a notice from HR?

31:12.880 --> 31:13.920
What notice?

31:15.140 --> 31:17.230
Wasn't there a rumor about layoffs before?

31:17.230 --> 31:18.760
Right after you took leave,

31:18.790 --> 31:19.590
HR started calling people

31:19.590 --> 31:21.250
from our team for interviews.

31:21.420 --> 31:22.920
They are using your absence

31:22.920 --> 31:23.750
to target us.

31:24.730 --> 31:26.030
I've already been interviewed.

31:26.030 --> 31:28.030
I feel like they'll talk to you soon.

31:29.100 --> 31:29.910
Wait for me.

31:29.970 --> 31:32.700
I'll go back
as soon as I finish the family business.

31:32.700 --> 31:33.620
No.

31:33.620 --> 31:34.700
When the property market was so good,

31:34.700 --> 31:36.290
we made them so much money.

31:36.550 --> 31:37.340
Now that the market is bad,

31:37.340 --> 31:38.740
they just want to fire us.

31:38.920 --> 31:41.070
Ms. Xia, you should make plans early too.

31:41.070 --> 31:42.840
What plans can I make?

31:42.840 --> 31:43.710
Now that I've lost my job,

31:43.710 --> 31:45.290
who's going to pay my mortgage?

31:45.290 --> 31:46.160
Don't worry.

31:46.790 --> 31:47.750
I've got some things to take care of,

31:47.750 --> 31:49.150
so I'll talk to you later.

32:02.510 --> 32:03.360
Uh,

32:05.080 --> 32:06.640
w-what a coincidence.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.980
Sorry, I don't want to talk right now.

32:11.470 --> 32:12.530
M-My condolences.

32:15.640 --> 32:17.320
I didn't mean

32:17.460 --> 32:19.170
the layoff thing earlier.

32:19.170 --> 32:20.340
I meant...

32:20.340 --> 32:22.340
tonight, about that black box,

32:22.340 --> 32:23.680
y-your dad...

32:50.730 --> 32:52.510
The thin-skinned buns.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.960
I'll learn how to make them someday.

32:56.960 --> 32:58.490
Then I'll make them for you.

33:07.100 --> 33:11.310
[2014]

33:07.680 --> 33:08.880
My dear wife is here.

33:08.900 --> 33:10.560
Do you have any instructions?

33:17.700 --> 33:18.830
Teach me how to ride.

33:20.990 --> 33:22.590
When you're working abroad,

33:22.620 --> 33:23.880
I might need it.

33:26.100 --> 33:27.230
My dear wife, you...

33:27.710 --> 33:28.360
So,

33:28.850 --> 33:30.110
you agreed to let me go?

33:31.660 --> 33:32.640
You supported me

33:33.230 --> 33:34.960
working in Xinjiang back then.

33:35.010 --> 33:37.140
Now it's my turn to support your dream.

33:50.860 --> 33:53.310
Just don't come back
missing an arm or a leg.

33:53.810 --> 33:55.810
Otherwise, I won't take care of you.

33:58.440 --> 33:59.290
I promise.

34:26.080 --> 34:28.250
Mom, how about I move back in with you?

34:29.820 --> 34:31.510
You finally come back.

34:31.820 --> 34:33.480
Spend more time with Grandma.

35:14.460 --> 35:15.510
Grandma.

35:19.380 --> 35:20.570
Grandma.

35:22.490 --> 35:23.380
Tell me,

35:24.780 --> 35:25.780
why is life so hard

35:26.110 --> 35:29.110
when you grow up?

35:31.220 --> 35:32.220
Granddaughter.

35:32.990 --> 35:37.690
The sun of Kashgar lights up
a thousand roads,

35:38.380 --> 35:43.050
and your shadow will tell you
which one to take.

35:51.190 --> 35:52.110
You silly girl,

35:52.140 --> 35:55.310
are you trying to break my old bones?

35:59.030 --> 36:00.880
Grandma.

36:03.550 --> 36:05.840
Don't eat so many chickpeas.

37:31.550 --> 37:32.130
Zi.

37:33.670 --> 37:35.530
Today is your first day of school.

37:35.900 --> 37:37.030
When you get to school,

37:37.030 --> 37:38.860
don't ever fight with your classmates.

37:38.860 --> 37:39.320
Okay.

37:40.190 --> 37:42.470
Just because you are the boss at the inn

37:42.820 --> 37:44.280
doesn't mean you'll be the same at school.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.150
Those boys out there are wild.

37:59.030 --> 37:59.860
Dad.

38:01.030 --> 38:02.220
Hurry up, Zi.

38:06.030 --> 38:06.940
Did you miss me?

38:06.940 --> 38:07.650
I did.

38:08.240 --> 38:09.820
Are you enjoying your first day at school?

38:09.820 --> 38:10.440
I am.

38:12.960 --> 38:13.470
Dad.

38:15.710 --> 38:17.570
You used to wait for me to come home

38:18.570 --> 38:21.090
under that big tree,
through rain or wind.

38:22.630 --> 38:24.570
You hoped I could be a little dove

38:25.100 --> 38:26.310
flying freely.

38:29.030 --> 38:29.880
I'm sorry.

38:31.090 --> 38:32.460
I let you down.

38:34.260 --> 38:35.010
Now,

38:36.510 --> 38:38.220
you'll never wait for me

38:38.220 --> 38:39.680
under that big tree again.

38:44.220 --> 38:46.280
This time, returning to my hometown,

38:46.630 --> 38:48.030
where will Satar's music

38:49.380 --> 38:51.010
take me?

39:29.130 --> 39:31.690
Welcome aboard Bus 943,

39:31.690 --> 39:33.860
bound for Pu'an Road, Yan'an East Road.

39:33.860 --> 39:36.320
Welcome aboard Bus 943,

39:33.960 --> 39:37.660
[Shanghai 7 months ago]

39:36.320 --> 39:38.760
bound for Pu'an Road, Yan'an East Road.

39:40.460 --> 39:42.340
Everyone, thank you for
continuing to follow

39:42.340 --> 39:44.000
our homeowners' live stream.

39:44.070 --> 39:45.320
The Rose Garden housing project

39:45.320 --> 39:46.720
has been suspended for two months,

39:46.720 --> 39:49.320
yet we are still
paying our mortgages as usual.

39:49.420 --> 39:50.990
I want to ask when the developer

39:50.990 --> 39:52.970
will give us an explanation.

39:52.970 --> 39:53.960
The longer this goes on,

39:53.960 --> 39:55.970
the more disappointed we become.

40:04.970 --> 40:05.610
Zi.

40:05.820 --> 40:06.530
Dad.

40:07.380 --> 40:08.130
Zi.

40:09.740 --> 40:12.140
Did you go to Huaqiao
to see the house again?

40:12.220 --> 40:14.670
Isn't it just six months
until the handover?

40:14.670 --> 40:15.380
Dad.

40:16.170 --> 40:18.220
Well, about the house...

40:18.590 --> 40:18.990
What?

40:19.130 --> 40:19.530
No, no.

40:19.530 --> 40:21.130
It's lagging. It's lagging.

40:21.740 --> 40:22.670
What did you say?

40:23.840 --> 40:26.040
I didn't hear you. What did you just say?

40:26.280 --> 40:26.900
Well,

40:27.320 --> 40:29.650
I called to tell you something important.

40:30.580 --> 40:31.100
You,

40:31.300 --> 40:32.960
take a look at your own WeChat Moments.

40:32.960 --> 40:34.320
Okay, I'll hang up first.

40:34.320 --> 40:35.460
I'll go take a look.

40:53.920 --> 40:55.380
I knew you couldn't sleep.

40:55.480 --> 40:57.210
We're here to keep you company.

41:06.880 --> 41:08.190
Cry if you want to.

41:08.190 --> 41:10.450
There's no one else here, just let it out.

41:12.530 --> 41:13.960
Do you two know

41:15.610 --> 41:17.260
what the last sentence my dad wrote to me

41:17.260 --> 41:18.090
was?

41:18.800 --> 41:19.360
What?

41:23.480 --> 41:28.180
[My leader must be a jellyfish.
Not only brainless, but also toxic]

41:28.210 --> 41:32.670
[Dad: please delete this...]

41:29.930 --> 41:31.460
I really didn't expect this

41:32.070 --> 41:34.360
to be the last time I talked to my dad.

41:35.590 --> 41:36.400
I thought

41:38.900 --> 41:40.610
I had already moved on.

41:42.150 --> 41:42.690
But...

41:53.150 --> 41:53.670
Dad,

41:55.740 --> 41:57.000
after you passed away,

41:57.360 --> 41:59.820
everyone told me that
I just have to accept it

42:00.220 --> 42:01.760
and live a good life,

42:02.020 --> 42:03.730
but I'm really hurting.

42:05.990 --> 42:07.650
How could the last words we said

42:07.650 --> 42:09.260
to each other be these?
